    "sentence_translations": [
      "(2) Daxing Is Tired",
      "",
      "It is now 10 pm on Friday. Daxing doesn’t want to study anymore. I think he is a little tired.",
      "",
      "Daxing said, “Xiaomi, where are you?”",
      "",
      "I said, “I am here.”",
      "",
      "Daxing said, “I am a little unhappy.”",
      "",
      "I asked him, “What’s up?”",
      "",
      "“Studying is very tiring. I don’t want to study anymore.",
      "But, I’m in my third year of senior high. I want to go to a good university, so I have to study.”",
      "Daxing looked at me and said, “Are you tired?”",
      "",
      "I said, “I’m not tired. You’re tired. Do you want to watch a movie?”",
      "",
      "Daxing said, “I don’t want to watch a movie.”",
      "",
      "“Do you want to play Pokemon?” I asked Daxing. I know Daxing likes to play Pokemon.",
      "",
      "But Daxing said, “I don’t want to play today.”",
      "",
      "I want Daxing to be happy, so I asked him, “What do you want to do today?”",
      "",
      "Daxing said, “I … I want to sleep.”"
    ]
